{"synopsis":"Seorang pemuda bernama Han Sunghyun kehilangan keluarganya dalam sebuah penyerangan membabi buta oleh manusiamanusia super Ketika dia tinggal dengan mengucilkan diri karena traume akibat insiden itu suatu hari dia membangkitkan kekuatan untuk mengendalikan avatar untuk menggantikan dirinya\nApa Aku bisa mengirim avatar untuk berburu di otherworld yang berbahaya sementara aku tinggal dengan aman di rumah hanya dengan memperkuat kemampuanku\nSeiring avataravatarnya bertumbuh dengan pesat menyeberangi dimensi ras dan profesi Han Sunghyun mulai memburu para manusia super yang menyalahgunakan kekuatan mereka","alternative_title":"내 분신이 거물이 되어간다","author":"Lico, Silheom Sample","artist":"Hansa","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"05535c98-a535-4cf5-aae1-9375d8c3cf6c","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":"","date":"2026-06-20","released":"2026-06-20"},{"chapter_id":"00fdb705-3872-4a3b-9f22-73fff765d984","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"4f00b4ce-70b7-4b30-8914-a6ab0b519771","number":"80","chapter":"80","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"ac468a9f-be17-4654-9aa2-c7ae2e304c82","number":"79","chapter":"79","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"6718c97a-8276-4cf0-9d12-3a32f004caad","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"ff1b44d9-353e-4791-8918-4734f6fdf56e","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"","date":"2026-05-28","released":"2026-05-28"},{"chapter_id":"ab72ce4b-5f7d-4605-b33e-0ff33581d7f2","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"","date":"2026-05-15","released":"2026-05-15"},{"chapter_id":"ffb0ac85-7b75-4241-974c-a1518cbdcfd8","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"","date":"2026-05-15","released":"2026-05-15"},{"chapter_id":"7c630d89-1411-4178-bb46-fc8bd5a0a138","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"","date":"2026-05-15","released":"2026-05-15"},{"chapter_id":"52b0b640-bae6-4d34-9